{"unit_id": "tag:04NI:statement", "translation": "考虑概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）的交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0001>\n具有平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）垂直箭头（vertical arrows），以及一个点（point）<MATH_0002>映射（mapping）到<MATH_0003>。则纤维（fibres）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>是平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "vertical arrows", "target_term": "垂直箭头"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "mapping", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "交换图中的概形。"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "图中的态射。"}, {"source_term": "commutative diagram", "target_term": "交换图", "context": "所给交换图。"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "垂直箭头及纤维态射的平展性。"}, {"source_term": "vertical arrows", "target_term": "垂直箭头", "context": "所给图的垂直箭头。"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点", "context": "目标概形的点。"}, {"source_term": "mapping", "target_term": "映射", "context": "指定点的对应关系。"}, {"source_term": "fibres", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "相应的纤维。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "纤维之间的态射。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04NI:proof", "translation": "注意<MATH_0001>是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）的，因为它是平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>的换基（base change）。概形（scheme）<MATH_0003>是<MATH_0004>上的概形（scheme）。由态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0001>，概形（scheme）<MATH_0005>是<MATH_0006>的有限（finite）可分（separable）域（field）扩张（extensions）的谱（spectra）所成的不交并（disjoint union）。其中之一是<MATH_0007>。因此<MATH_0008>是<MATH_0009>的开闭子概形（open and closed subscheme），从而<MATH_0010>是平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）的（它是一个复合（composition），由开浸入（open immersion）与一个平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）态射（morphism）组成，见态射（Morphisms），第<REF_0002>节）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "换基"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "separable", "target_term": "可分"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域"}, {"source_term": "extensions", "target_term": "扩张"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并"}, {"source_term": "open and closed subscheme", "target_term": "开闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展", "context": "态射的平展性。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "被换基及复合所用的态射。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "换基", "context": "平展态射的换基。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "证明中的概形。"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射", "context": "引用章名。"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限", "context": "剩余域扩张的有限性。"}, {"source_term": "separable", "target_term": "可分", "context": "域扩张的可分性。"}, {"source_term": "field", "target_term": "域", "context": "剩余域。"}, {"source_term": "extensions", "target_term": "扩张", "context": "剩余域扩张。"}, {"source_term": "spectra", "target_term": "谱", "context": "域扩张的谱。"}, {"source_term": "disjoint union", "target_term": "不交并", "context": "平展纤维的分解。"}, {"source_term": "open and closed subscheme", "target_term": "开闭子概形", "context": "纤维作为开闭子概形。"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合", "context": "两个态射的复合。"}, {"source_term": "open immersion", "target_term": "开浸入", "context": "所复合的开浸入。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:04R5:prose-0003", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n给定概形（schemes）的芽（germs）的一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>，可以将<TEXTITOPEN_0001>纤维（fibre）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>定义为芽（germs）<MATH_0002>的同构（isomorphism）类（class），其中<MATH_0003>是任意一个代表（representative）。我们将经常滥用记号（abuse notation），直接写<MATH_0004>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "germs", "target_term": "芽"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维"}, {"source_term": "germs", "target_term": "芽"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "class", "target_term": "类"}, {"source_term": "representative", "target_term": "代表"}, {"source_term": "abuse notation", "target_term": "滥用记号"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "所给芽的概形。"}, {"source_term": "germs", "target_term": "芽", "context": "概形芽及纤维芽。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "所给芽态射。"}, {"source_term": "fibre", "target_term": "纤维", "context": "定义的芽态射纤维。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构", "context": "芽的同构关系。"}, {"source_term": "class", "target_term": "类", "context": "芽的同构类。"}, {"source_term": "representative", "target_term": "代表", "context": "芽态射的代表。"}, {"source_term": "abuse notation", "target_term": "滥用记号", "context": "以纤维代表同构类的记号。"}], "notes": []}
